[#4471](/kb/incidents/4471) was marked *known: one issue, one fix queued*. Read the reports and it
holds three problems. Engineering closed #4471 on 5 October 2026, and that closed two of them:

| problem | state | ticket |
|---|---|---|
| `parser` | **fixed**: `fix(dates): parse dd/mm for eu locales` | [#1](https://github.com/Piastoll/challenge3/issues/1) closed |
| `hint` | **won't fix**: booking-v3 form retired | [#2](https://github.com/Piastoll/challenge3/issues/2) closed |
| `shift` | **open**: nobody has worked on it | [#3](https://github.com/Piastoll/challenge3/issues/3) open |

